  triage:closureNote "Fixed by commit 210d14019248982743b9a16c290f1c31ce28cd26 (docs(benchmark): retain Wyvern render transcript) on feature/ao2-15-benchmark-official-trigger, merged to integrate/phase-ao2. New evidence file 20260824T030844Z-rand-m5.ao2-11-wyvern-render-20260826.md retains the actual `WYVERN_VIEWER=none just benchmark-show` invocation and its real stdout (WYVERN_DIALOG_URL=..., exit status 0), satisfying AC5's 'wyvern stdout log' evidence option (the original prose-only file remains alongside it, not replaced). quality-mgr independently re-verified WYVERN_VIEWER/WYVERN_DIALOG_URL are genuine, documented behavior of the externally-installed wyvern binary (confirmed via `wyvern --help` and a live repro run producing the identical output shape with a different random port) -- initially suspected fabrication, disproven by direct reproduction." ;
